    "intro_html":  "This is the good part of Thanksgiving without the four days of preparation or the relatives. Turkey and peas in a poultry-seasoned gravy, stuffing baked golden across the top, all of it in one pan on a random Tuesday. Each serving lands at {{cal}} calories with \u003cstrong\u003e{{protein}} grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e for about \u003cstrong\u003e${{cost_ps}}\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost). Boxed stuffing mix is one of the cheapest carbohydrates in the store, and it never once pretended otherwise.",
